{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A PURE POOL PRO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Rackhaus, an intimate luxury pool hall high above the city, and be among the first to experience Pure Pool Pro, the sequel to the critically acclaimed Pure Pool. Powered by hyper-realistic physics, pinpoint-precise controls, and stunning visuals, this Demo offers a first taste of what\u2019s to come in the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969200/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.poster.avif?t=1759481166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969200/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.webm?t=1759481166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969200/extras/4fb013d724e18261e0f87eb2d987bb49.mp4?t=1759481166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT\u2019S INCLUDED IN THE DEMO</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Brand-New Look - Enjoy lifelike lighting, ray-traced ball reflections, and incredibly detailed table surfaces, complete with baize fuzz and clear coat imperfections. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Freeplay' in the Rackhaus \u2013 Rack up as many times as you like to get to grips with the feel of Pure Pool Pro\u2019s  physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Practice' 8-Ball and 9-Ball Matches \u2013 Test yourself against four of the game\u2019s lifelike AI opponents, Ethan Cruz, Amber De Wit, Iosifina Gatou, and Felix Song, each with distinct play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redesigned UI - A streamlined, modern, intuitive interface keeps you in the game with less waiting and more playing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph